select 'acids-bases', 'Henderson–Hasselbalch equation: Derivation', 'Following these assumptions, the Henderson–Hasselbalch equation is derived in a few logarithmic steps.', 'Wikipedia: Henderson–Hasselbalch equation', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Henderson%E2%80%93Hasselbalch_equation&oldid=1381152166', 'CC BY-SA 4.0. Wikipedia contributors (see page history). Excerpted and split into passages.'
